"情報提供・即時通信サービスを提供する場合、ユーザーに真実の身元情報の提供を義務付けなければならない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/26-08","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"16歳未満の者へのライブ配信許可禁止、投げ銭（ギフティング）は年齢に応じて段階的に処理"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/26-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"権利侵害の通知を受けた際は速やかに処理すること。異議申し立ての転送後、15日以内に進展がなければ復旧させる"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/26-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"ユーザー情報は安易に国外へ持ち出さないでください。国外への持ち出しには法的な条件と人数制限があります"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/26-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"サーバー選びは、まずダウンタイムに耐えられるか、次に運用担当者がいるかを確認し、最後に価格を比較すること"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/26"},"children":["第26章"," ·"," ","ウェブサイトやプラットフォームの構築：資格、届出、サーバー"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"26-08"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["08"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["16歳未満の者へのライブ配信許可禁止、投げ銭（ギフティング）は年齢に応じて段階的に処理"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["16歳未満の者は、あなたのサイトで配信アカウントを登録することはできません。16歳以上の場合は、身元認証に加え、親またはその他の保護者の同意が必要です。投げ銭は3段階に分かれます：8歳未満は投げ銭禁止、8歳から16歳は保護者の同意が必要、16歳以上は保護者の同意または収入証明の認証が必要です。子供が保護者に無断で行った投げ銭について、保護者が返金を求めた場合、裁判所は返還を命じる判決を下します。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。登録と支払いの2つのステップに、それぞれプロセスを追加します。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["法律の原文では「ネットワークライブ配信サービス提供者は、16歳未満の未成年者に対してネットワークライブ配信投稿者アカウントの登録サービスを提供してはならない。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：16歳未満の者へのライブ配信許可禁止、投げ銭（ギフティング）は年齢に応じて段階的に処理"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。登録と支払いの2つのステップに、それぞれプロセスを追加します。まず年齢を判定し、次に保護者の同意を確認します。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["法律の原文では「ネットワークライブ配信サービス提供者は、16歳未満の未成年者に対してネットワークライブ配信投稿者アカウントの登録サービスを提供してはならない。16歳以上の未成年者に対してネットワークライブ配信投稿者アカウントの登録サービスを提供する場合、その身分情報を認証し、その父母またはその他の法定代理人の同意を得なければならない」とされています。また、条例は「ネットワークライブ配信投稿者の真の身分情報を動的に検証するメカニズムを構築すること」を要求しており、配信者の身分をいつでも再確認できるようにする必要があります。さらに、「異なる年齢層の未成年者がサービスを利用する際の、1回あたりの消費額および1日あたりの累計消費額を合理的に制限すること」も求められており、年齢に応じて未成年者の1回および1日あたりの支払い上限を設定しなければなりません。投げ銭（ギフティング）については、現在3つの区分があります。「8歳未満の未成年者に対して投げ銭サービスを提供してはならない。」8歳から16歳未満の未成年者に対して投げ銭サービスを提供する場合、その法定代理人の同意を得なければならない。16歳以上の未成年者に対して投げ銭サービスを提供する場合、法定代理人の同意を得るか、あるいは収入証明書類を確認しなければならない」。また、もう一点：制限行為能力者が法定代理人の同意を得ずに投げ銭を行った場合、法定代理人が返金を求めた際、裁判所はこれを支持し、返金が可能である。制限行為能力者とは、法律上、完全な自己決定権を持たない未成年者を指す（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2020). 未成年人保护法（第七十四、七十六条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2020-10/22/c_1604928959588622.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cac.gov.cn/2020-10/22/c_1604928959588622.htm"]}," ; 国务院 (2023). 未成年人网络保护条例（国务院令第 766 号，第三十一、四十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2023/issue_10806/202311/content_6913813.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2023/issue_10806/202311/content_6913813.html"]}," ; 中央网信办秘书局 (2026). 关于加强网络直播打赏规范管理的通知（第 7 项）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2026-04/13/c_1777815804150225.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cac.gov.cn/2026-04/13/c_1777815804150225.htm"]}," ; 最高人民法院 (2020). 关于依法妥善审理涉新冠肺炎疫情民事案件若干问题的指导意见（二）（法发〔2020〕17 号，第九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/fabu/xiangqing/230181.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/fabu/xiangqing/230181.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2020-10/22/c_1604928959588622.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["実際に返金紛争が発生した場合は、未成年者に最も有利な方向で処理します。この件に関する表現は変更されました。2022年の4部門による意見書と、広電総局の2020年の通知では、いずれも「未成年者の投げ銭は一律禁止」とされています。2026年4月の新しい通知では、8歳と__しても16歳で段階分けする形に変更されましたが、前の2つの文書が無効であるとは明記されておらず、当局も両者の接続方法について言及していません。そのため、「未成年者の投げ銭は一律禁止」という表現は、現在は不正確です。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/26-07"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7